  "meta": {
    "about": "CadCraft → VectorCraft → array engine. CadCraft draws a 95 mm coaster with a ring of twelve vent holes and a hexagon centre; VectorCraft makes it cutter-ready (hairline red cut strokes, outlines offset by half the 0.1 mm kerf); the array engine rasterizes the cut file and labels each separate piece, so you can see at a glance how many parts will fall out of the sheet before you burn any plywood. Outputs the cut SVG and PDF and the parts preview.",
    "tags": [
      "fabrication",
      "laser"
    ],
    "title": "Laser-cut coasters"
  },
